  m_Name: Mystery_VesperToast
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AssassinMystery::AssassinMystery.MysteryData
  title: The Vesper Toast
  subtitle: A Medieval Assassination Mystery
  briefing: 'Castle Aldmere, midwinter. At noon a note was pinned to the guardroom
    door: <i>"Royal blood will be spilled at the vesper bell."</i>


    Captain
    Brienne Hale has summoned you in secret. Two royals are in the castle tonight:
    Queen Isolde and her brother, Duke Edric. The feast has begun, and the vesper
    bell rings in ten minutes.


    Question the household, search the Great Hall,
    the Library and the Basement, and compare what people say with what you find.
    When you can prove who the assassin is (motive, means and opportunity), make
    your accusation from the notebook. A false accusation costs precious time.'
  target: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 50c22b3f22f7a454db36fd95f86348ec, type: 2}
  suspects:
